{"id":3803,"path":"/grammar-points/a1/questions/","parentId":540,"order":60,"section":"grammar-points","level":"a1","depth":3,"title":"Questions: Word order and question words","seo":{"title":"Questions: Word order and question words - Test-English","description":"Learn how to form questions and use correct word order in this A1 Elementary grammar lesson. Clear rules, charts and exercises. Practise now!","image":"/media/uploads/A1%E2%80%93Grammar_Question-order.png"},"modified":"2026-02-18T10:11:45","kind":"lesson","parts":["<h3>Exercise 1</h3> <h5>Choose the correct questions.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"434\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 2</h3> <h5>Complete the sentences with the correct question word.</h5> <p class=\"textBox\"><del>what</del> –&nbsp;what time – where (x2) – when – why – who – how (x2) – how old – how often</p> <p><em>EXAMPLE: ‘<span class=\"textGap\">What</span> do you have for breakfast?’ ‘A sandwich.’</em><br> </p><div data-quiz=\"435\"></div> <p></p>","<h3>Exercise 3</h3> <h5>Write questions about the underlined words. We give you the question word.</h5> <p><em>EXAMPLE: We are <span>in Scotland</span>. ⇒ Where <span class=\"textGap\">are you</span>?</em><br> </p><div data-quiz=\"436\"></div> <p></p>","<h3>Exercise 4</h3> <h5>Write questions about the underlined words. In the question, use the <span class=\"highlighter\">same verb</span> as in the original sentence.</h5> <p></p> <p class=\"textBox\">where <del>(x2)</del> – when (x2) – what colour – why – who – how – how old – how often (x2)</p> <p><em>EXAMPLE: We are <span>in Scotland</span>. ⇒ <span class=\"textGap\">Where are you</span>?</em><br> </p><div data-quiz=\"437\"></div> <p></p>"],"explanation":"<h2>Word order in present simple questions</h2> <p>The <a href=\"/grammar-points/a1/basic-word-order-in-english/\">order of words</a> in an English question in present simple is <strong>QWASI</strong>: (<strong>Question Word) + Auxiliary + Subject + Infinitive</strong>.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>What do you do?</em></li> <li><em>Where do they live?</em></li> </ul> <p>In&nbsp;<strong>Yes-No questions</strong>&nbsp;(questions that we answer saying&nbsp;<strong>yes</strong>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<strong>no</strong>) there is <strong>NO Question Word</strong>.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>Do you speak English?</em></li> <li><em>Does she live here?</em></li> </ul> <p>The <strong>auxiliary verb</strong> in present simple is <strong>be&nbsp;</strong>or&nbsp;<strong>do/does</strong>. Below, you can see a grammar chart on the order of words in present simple questions with <strong>be&nbsp;</strong>or&nbsp;<strong>do/does</strong>.<br> <br> <img src=\"/media/uploads/Present-simple-questions.png\" alt=\"Grammar chart for A1 elementary English learners showing the word order of Present Simple questions with 'be' and 'do', including question words, auxiliary verbs, subjects, and main verbs.\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-10750\" loading=\"lazy\"><br> </p> <h6></h6> <h4>Questions with <strong>am/is/are</strong></h4> <p>When the verb in the sentence is&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"/grammar-points/a1/present-simple-forms-of-to-be/\">be</a></strong>, we use&nbsp;<strong>am/is/are</strong> as the auxiliary verb&nbsp;<strong>before</strong> the subject. Then the word order is <strong>QWAS</strong>: (<strong>Question Word) + Auxiliary (am/is/are) + Subject</strong></p> <h4>Questions with&nbsp;<strong>do/does</strong></h4> <p>When we have a verb that is not&nbsp;<strong>be</strong>, we use&nbsp;<strong>do/does</strong> as the auxiliary verb.<br> We use&nbsp;<strong>does&nbsp;</strong>with&nbsp;<strong>he/she/it</strong> and&nbsp;<strong>do</strong> with <strong>I/you/we/they</strong>. Remember that the main verb after the subject is in the infinitive form (NOT <strong>-s&nbsp;</strong>or&nbsp;<strong>-es</strong>).</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>What do<span><strong>es</strong></span> she <span><strong>do</strong></span>? <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></em></li> <li><em>What does she <span><strong>does</strong></span>? <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21426\" src=\"/media/uploads/wrong.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></em></li> <li><em>Where do<span><strong>es</strong></span><span>&nbsp;</span>he <span><strong>work</strong></span>? <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></em></li> <li><em>Where does<span>&nbsp;</span>he <span><strong>works</strong></span>?</em> <em><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21426\" src=\"/media/uploads/wrong.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></em></li> </ul> <h2>Question words – Grammar chart</h2> <p><img src=\"/media/uploads/Question-words-a1_new.png\" alt=\"Educational chart for A1 elementary English learners displaying different question words such as 'who', 'where', 'when', 'why', 'what', 'how', including example dialogues for each.\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-10751\" loading=\"lazy\"></p> <h6></h6> <h4><strong>What</strong> + noun</h4> <p>We often use the question word <strong>what + noun</strong> as a question word: <strong>what time, what colour, what size, etc.</strong></p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em><span><strong>What colour</strong></span> is your jacket?</em></li> <li><em><span><strong>What size</strong></span> do you want?</em></li> <li><em><span><strong>What car</strong></span> does he have?</em></li> </ul> <h4><strong>How</strong> + adjective/adverb</h4> <p>We can also use&nbsp;<strong>how</strong><strong> + adjective/adverb </strong>as a question word in phrases like&nbsp;<strong>how often, how old, how tall</strong><strong>, etc.</strong></p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em><span><strong>How fast</strong></span> is your car?</em></li> <li><em><span><strong>How big</strong> </span>is her house?</em></li> <li><em><span><strong>How often</strong> </span> do you play sports?</em></li> </ul>","quizzes":[{"id":434,"questions":[{"id":3759,"num":"1","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ to the gym?</div>","choices":[{"id":7810,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>How often you go</span>"},{"id":7811,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>How often you do go</span>"},{"id":7812,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>How often do you go</span>"},{"id":7813,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>How often go you</span>"}]},{"id":3760,"num":"2","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ ?</div>","choices":[{"id":7814,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>What time does she get up</span>"},{"id":7815,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>What time she does get up</span>"},{"id":7816,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>What time she gets up</span>"},{"id":7817,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>What time gets up she</span>"}]},{"id":3761,"num":"3","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ ?</div>","choices":[{"id":7818,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>Who is the man over there</span>"},{"id":7819,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>Who the man over there is</span>"},{"id":7820,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>Who the man is over there</span>"},{"id":7821,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>Who over there is the man</span>"}]},{"id":3762,"num":"4","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____?</div>","choices":[{"id":7822,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>Where your sister is from</span>"},{"id":7823,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>Where is your sister from</span>"},{"id":7824,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>Where from is your sister</span>"},{"id":7825,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>Where does your sister be from</span>"}]},{"id":3763,"num":"5","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____?</div>","choices":[{"id":7826,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>He does exercise</span>"},{"id":7827,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>He does do exercise</span>"},{"id":7828,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>Do he does exercise</span>"},{"id":7829,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>Does he do exercise</span>"}]},{"id":3764,"num":"6","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____?</div>","choices":[{"id":7830,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>Why you do want this job</span>"},{"id":7831,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>Why you want this job</span>"},{"id":7832,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>Why do you want this job</span>"},{"id":7833,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>Why want you this job</span>"}]},{"id":3765,"num":"7","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ for breakfast?</div>","choices":[{"id":7834,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>What they have</span>"},{"id":7835,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>What they do have</span>"},{"id":7836,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>What do they have</span>"},{"id":7837,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>What have they</span>"}]},{"id":3766,"num":"8","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____?</div>","choices":[{"id":7838,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>When you are free</span>"},{"id":7839,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>When free are you</span>"},{"id":7840,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>When do you be free</span>"},{"id":7841,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>When are you free</span>"}]},{"id":3767,"num":"9","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____?</div>","choices":[{"id":7842,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>How your sister is old</span>"},{"id":7843,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>How old is your sister</span>"},{"id":7844,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>How old your sister is </span>"},{"id":7845,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>How old does your sister be</span>"}]},{"id":3768,"num":"10","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____?</div>","choices":[{"id":7846,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>Is your friend from Canada</span>"},{"id":7847,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>Is from Canada your friend </span>"},{"id":7848,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>Your friend is from Canada</span>"},{"id":7849,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>Does your friend be from Canada</span>"}]}]},{"id":435,"questions":[{"id":3769,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>'<span data-gap=\"0\"></span> do you buy your vegetables?' 'In the market.'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3770,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>'<span data-gap=\"0\"></span> is your father?' 'He's 57.'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3771,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>'<span data-gap=\"0\"></span> are you in the library?' 'Because I have an exam and I need to study.'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3772,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>'<span data-gap=\"0\"></span> do you have your exam?' 'Next Monday.'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3773,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>'<span data-gap=\"0\"></span> do they have their breakfast?' 'At 7.'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3774,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>'<span data-gap=\"0\"></span> do you call when you need help?' 'Peter.'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3775,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>'<span data-gap=\"0\"></span> does John call you?' 'Every day.'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3776,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>'<span data-gap=\"0\"></span> do you go to work?' 'By bus.'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3777,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>'<span data-gap=\"0\"></span> tall is Ronny?' 'He's six feet tall.'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3778,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>'<span data-gap=\"0\"></span> do you spend your holidays?' 'We always go to a little village near the sea.'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]}]},{"id":436,"questions":[{"id":3780,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>She reads <span>magazines</span>. ⇒ What <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3781,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>My birthday is <span>on 10th April</span>. ⇒ When <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3782,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>She lives <span>in a big house</span>. ⇒ Where <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3783,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I study <span>because I want to learn</span>. ⇒ Why <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3784,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>She is <span>sometimes</span> wrong. ⇒ How often <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3785,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I love <span>Christina</span>. ⇒ Who <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3786,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I keep the money <span>in a safe</span>.. ⇒ Where <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3787,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I'm tired <span>because it's very late</span>. ⇒ Why <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>? </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3788,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>My doctor is <span>Dr Stevens</span>. ⇒ Who <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3789,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I clean the windows <span>with water and vinegar</span>. ⇒ How <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]}]},{"id":437,"questions":[{"id":3790,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>He is <span>sometimes</span> late for class. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3791,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I go to the mountains <span>in summer</span>. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3795,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I go <span>to the mountains</span> in summer. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3792,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>His car is <span>red</span>. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3793,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I am <span>very tired</span> after work. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3794,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I am very tired <span>after work</span>. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3796,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Jerry is <span>20 years old</span>. <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3797,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>He sees <span>Sarah</span> every weekend. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3798,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>He sees Sarah <span>every weekend</span>. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3799,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I call her <span>because I love her</span>. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>? </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]}]}]}